# Blog Post File Naming

Blog post filenames under `data/blog/**` must use `lower_case_with_underscore`
naming: lowercase letters, digits, and underscores only (no spaces, no
PascalCase/CamelCase, no hyphens).

```
# ❌ BAD
data/blog/Python/Asterisk_In_Function_Signatures.mdx
data/blog/Python/asterisk-in-function-signatures.mdx

# ✅ GOOD
data/blog/Python/asterisk_in_function_signatures.mdx
```

The post `title` in frontmatter can still use normal capitalization/spacing —
this rule only applies to the filename itself.
